DATA LICENCES — apps/glide-band/data
====================================
The code in this repository is MIT. The data under this directory is NOT,
and each source keeps its own terms. Both extracts here are DERIVED records;
their sources are recorded by URL and sha256 in PINS.json and are re-fetchable.

airports.json
  Derived from the OurAirports airports.csv dump
  (https://davidmegginson.github.io/ourairports-data/airports.csv).
  OurAirports releases its data into the PUBLIC DOMAIN. No restriction.
  Filtered here to the corridor bounding box of the pinned flight, with
  heliports, seaplane bases, balloonports and closed fields removed, and to
  the fields used by the instrument (ident, name, lat, lon, elevation, type,
  scheduled_service, municipality, region).

flight.json
  Derived from one ADS-B day ingested by apps/skyaudit from adsb.lol.
  Data (c) adsb.lol, released under the Open Database License (ODbL).
  Under ODbL: attribution is required, the database stays under ODbL, and
  any public use of a derived database must offer it under the same terms.
  The extract here is one aircraft's trace, thinned for display, and it
  carries the same terms as the source. Attribution appears on the built
  page and in apps/skyaudit's own notices.

Nothing under this directory may be relicensed by being copied out of it.
